{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064804/block/singleImage/3273038/df/01M7V2PB655JB7YZF7AEJN6X3B.jpg?updatedAt=1795134923\"/><figcaption>山頂柯士甸山道獨立屋遭撬窗爆竊，失4個Hermès手袋值約15萬。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>港島山頂有獨立屋發生爆竊案。昨日(19日)下午5時許，警方接獲一名外傭報案，指柯士甸山道24號至28號一幢獨立屋懷疑遭到爆竊。警員到場發現上址一間房間的窗戶被撬開，經初步點算，相信有4個名牌手袋不知所終。警方經初步調查後，案件列作爆竊，交由中區警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。據指，失竊的4個手袋都是Hermès，價值約15萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.701839+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.224940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:26:42.355444+00:00","content_hash":"5f06766b8b8fdbfbebdc40ed6d091f127272276c975cff3fa7d07714540e8395","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:20.701839+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}